{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1394","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Boboniu Chats with Du"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Have you ever used the chat application QQ? Well, in a chat group of QQ, administrators can muzzle a user for days."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In Boboniu's chat group, there's a person called Du Yi who likes to make fun of Boboniu every day."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Du will chat in the group for $$$n$$$ days. On the $$$i$$$-th day:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If Du can speak, he'll make fun of Boboniu with fun factor $$$a_i$$$. But after that, he may be muzzled depending on Boboniu's mood. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Otherwise, Du won't do anything. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Boboniu's mood is a constant $$$m$$$. On the $$$i$$$-th day:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If Du can speak and $$$a_i \\gt m$$$, then Boboniu will be angry and muzzle him for $$$d$$$ days, which means that Du won't be able to speak on the $$$i+1, i+2, \\cdots, \\min(i+d,n)$$$-th days. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Otherwise, Boboniu won't do anything. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The total fun factor is the sum of the fun factors on the days when Du can speak."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Du asked you to find the maximum total fun factor among all possible permutations of $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$d$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1\\le d\\le n\\le 10^5,0\\le m\\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots,a_n$$$ ($$$0\\le a_i\\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer: the maximum total fun factor among all permutations of $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 2 11\n8 10 15 23 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n48\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n20 2 16\n20 5 8 2 18 16 2 16 16 1 5 16 2 13 6 16 4 17 21 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n195\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, you can set $$$a'=[15, 5, 8, 10, 23]$$$. Then Du's chatting record will be:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Make fun of Boboniu with fun factor $$$15$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Be muzzled. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Be muzzled. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Make fun of Boboniu with fun factor $$$10$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Make fun of Boboniu with fun factor $$$23$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus the total fun factor is $$$48$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1394A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1394/problem/A"}